meta {
  name: Workspace audit log
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/audit-log?pageSize=50
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  pageSize: 50
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Workspace ADMIN only - everything, private projects included. Add actorId=... to see one
  person's actions; the teammate's id is memberUserId.

  Members joining (through an invitation), changing role, being removed or leaving are here as
  MEMBER entries. Someone losing access also shows on each issue they were taken off, as
  UNASSIGNED with reason LOST_ACCESS.

  The log is append-only: the database refuses to change or delete an entry.
}
